------------------
That repository states the Unlicense but does not say where its word data
originally came from. Two things reduce the risk this leaves. A list of the
words of a language is very largely a collection of facts rather than a
creative work. And every OTHER word list in the source corpus was deliberately
EXCLUDED from what ships, precisely because their provenance is unknown: they
are used only locally, to measure accuracy, which redistributes nothing.
If better provenance emerges, this entry should be corrected to match.


